{"suttaId":"tha-ap473","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"Ap-ii","vriCode":"s0510m2.mul","paras":[1536,1559],"vripara":"1"},"segments":{"tha-ap473:0.3":"Naḷamāliyattheraapadānaṃ","tha-ap473:1.1":"“Suvaṇṇavaṇṇaṃ sambuddhaṃ, āhutīnaṃ paṭiggahaṃ;","tha-ap473:1.3":"Vipinaggena gacchantaṃ, addasaṃ lokanāyakaṃ.","tha-ap473:2.1":"“Naḷamālaṃ gahetvāna, nikkhamanto ca tāvade;","tha-ap473:2.3":"Tatthaddasāsiṃ sambuddhaṃ, oghatiṇṇamanāsavaṃ.","tha-ap473:3.1":"“Pasannacitto sumano, naḷamālamapūjayiṃ;","tha-ap473:3.3":"Dakkhiṇeyyaṃ mahāvīraṃ, sabbalokānukampakaṃ.","tha-ap473:4.1":"“Ekatiṃse ito kappe, yaṃ mālamabhiropayiṃ [pupphamabhiropayiṃ (sī. syā. pī.)];","tha-ap473:4.3":"Duggatiṃ nābhijānāmi, buddhapūjāyidaṃ phalaṃ.","tha-ap473:5.1":"“Kilesā jhāpitā mayhaṃ, bhavā sabbe samūhatā;","tha-ap473:5.3":"Nāgova bandhanaṃ chetvā, viharāmi anāsavo.","tha-ap473:6.1":"“Svāgataṃ vata me āsi, mama buddhassa santike;","tha-ap473:6.3":"Tisso vijjā anuppattā, kataṃ buddhassa sāsanaṃ.","tha-ap473:7.1":"“Paṭisambhidā catasso, vimokkhāpi ca aṭṭhime;","tha-ap473:7.3":"Chaḷabhiññā sacchikatā, kataṃ buddhassa sāsanaṃ”.","tha-ap473:8.1":"Itthaṃ sudaṃ āyasmā naḷamāliyo thero imā gāthāyo Abhāsitthāti.","tha-ap473:9.1":"Naḷamāliyattherassāpadānaṃ paṭhamaṃ."},"attha":null,"tika":null,"tika2":null}
